# un-ignore our compose wrapper (ignored by some global gitignores)
!bin/compose
# bin/deploy-to's host-local deploy-state dir (active-app-slot,
# max-upload-mb - see CLAUDE.md's edge-recreate footgun bullet and
# infra/edge/18-deploy-state.envsh) - written into each deploy host's
# checkout, never meant to be tracked. .active-app-slot is the old
# pre-2026-08-10 single-file location, kept ignored in case a stale one is
# still lying around on some host's checkout.
.deploy-state/
.active-app-slot

# Defensive: never track certs/keys, coverage output, or local-only Claude state
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.jks
coverage/
.remember/
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
